You plant your tentacle hand in the ground where it splits up and extends to a target zone of radius 3.

The zone will erupt with many black tendrils to hit all foes caught inside dealing [233%, 255%, 272%, 287%, 300% (TL1-5)] tentacle damage.

Any creature hit by the tentacle must save against spell or be numbed by the attack, reducing its damage by [22%, 29%, 32%, 35%, 37% (TL1-5)] for 5 turns.

If at least one enemy is hit you gain 20 insanity.

When constricting:The tendrils pummel your constricted target for [350%, 383%, 409%, 430%, 450% (TL1-5)] tentacle damage and if adjacent you make an additional mainhand weapon attack.  Talent cooldown reduced to 10.
